ehara Kazuha","r":[0.2148,0.7296,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Neuvillette","r":[0.0815,0.7904,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1259,0.7904,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Escoffier","r":[0.1704,0.7904,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Citlali","r":[0.2148,0.7904,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Neuvillette","r":[0.0815,0.8511,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1259,0.8511,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Raiden Shogun","r":[0.1704,0.8511,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Zhongli","r":[0.2148,0.8511,0.037,0.0296]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/neuvillette/261111-225142/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Tome of the Eternal Flow","text":"CRIT DMG, HP and Charged Attack damage perfectly match his kit; refunds Energy when its HP change stacks are consumed."},{"name":"Surf's Up","text":"High CD and HP; useful as a stat stick."},{"name":"Jadefall's Splendor","text":"HP and some Energy support help his beam build, but its shield and Burst related passive is not fully utilized."},{"name":"Lost Prayer to the Sacred Winds","text":"CRIT Rate and stacking Elemental DMG help sustained field time, but the stacks reset when he swaps."},{"name":"Sacrificial Jade","text":"CR and an off-field HP buff boost his beams. Swap out before its HP buff expires to maintain uptime."},{"name":"Prototype Amber","text":"HP, Burst Energy refund and party healing make it his most practical freely craftable weapon. Especially good when Energy or Furina Fanfare is needed."},{"name":"Ash-Graven Drinking Horn","text":"HP and periodic area damage can edge out Prototype Amber if Energy needs are already low. Low ER requirement; no Burst Energy refund. R5 preferred."},{"name":"The Widsith","text":"CRIT DMG is useful, but only its Elemental DMG song boosts his damage reliably; ATK and EM rolls are often wasted. Inconsistent passive."}],"a":[{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"His own HP changes activate all three CR stacks.","stats":"HP% · Hydro DMG/HP% · CRIT DMG/CRIT Rate"},{"names":["Heart of Depth"],"text":"Boosts Hydro damage and Charged Attacks after using Skill, but falls behind Marechaussee Hunter.","stats":"HP% · Hydro DMG/HP% · CRIT"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Vourukasha's Glow"],"text":"Two HP bonuses make a workable temporary set while farming Marechaussee Hunter.","stats":"HP% · Hydro DMG/HP% · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Judgment Day","members":["Neuvillette","Furina","Kaedehara Kazuha","Xilonen"],"text":"Furina buffs the beam and activates Hydro Resonance. Kazuha buffs Hydro and shreds RES; Xilonen adds shred and healing. C0 needs careful dodging.","roles":["Main DPS","Hydro Buff","Anemo Buff","Healer / Shred"]},{"name":"Moonlight Verdict","members":["Neuvillette","Columbina","Ineffa","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Columbina and Ineffa enable Lunar-Charged while Neuvillette drives with Hydro beams. Kazuha groups enemies and shreds Hydro RES.","roles":["Main DPS","Hydro / Lunar","Electro / Shield","Anemo Buff"]},{"name":"Frozen in Court","members":["Neuvillette","Furina","Escoffier","Citlali"],"text":"Furina buffs Neuvillette, Escoffier heals and shreds Cryo/Hydro RES, while Citlali shields and helps Freeze susceptible enemies.","roles":["Main DPS","Hydro Buff","Cryo Healer","Cryo Shield"]},{"name":"Bloom and Order","members":["Neuvillette","Nahida","Raiden Shogun","Zhongli"],"text":"Neuvillette creates cores with Nahida; full EM Raiden triggers Hyperbloom off-field, and Zhongli shields against interruptions.","roles":["Hydro Driver","Dendro","Hyperbloom Trigger","Shield"]}],"v":"C0 Shield Comfort: Use Zhongli or Citlali when beam interruptions are a problem. C1 allows more freedom to run buff heavy teams.\nLunar-Charged: Pair with Columbina and Ineffa for Lunar-Charged damage. Keep Neuvillette on his normal HP and CRIT build.\nHyperbloom Driver: Pair with Nahida and a full EM Electro trigger. Neuvillette stays on his normal beam build while producing Bloom cores.\nBudget Build: Use Prototype Amber with Marechaussee Hunter. Its HP, Energy refund and healing make it an excellent accessible option.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Neuvillette is an HP-scaling Hydro carry whose Charged Attacks deliver sustained area damage. Sourcewater Droplets speed up his beams and restore HP. At C0, a shield or careful positioning helps prevent interruptions; C1 gives him more freedom with team building.","pros":["Powerful Hydro beams","Strong area damage","Self healing","Flexible team options"],"cons":["C0 interruptions","Charged Attack focus","Hydro immune foes","Needs Droplet rotation"],"weapons":["Tome of the Eternal Flow","Surf's Up","Jadefall's Splendor","Lost Prayer to the Sacred Winds","Sacrificial Jade","Prototype Amber","Ash-Graven Drinking Horn","The Widsith"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Alternative"},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Vourukasha's Glow"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"HP Mix"}],"main":["HP%","Hydro DMG Bonus / HP%","CRIT DMG / CRIT Rate / HP%"],"stats":["HP: 35,000 - 45,000+","CRIT Rate: 45% - 64% (before set)","CRIT DMG: 180% - 250%+","Energy Recharge: 100% - 135%","CRIT Rate cap: 64% with 4pc MH"],"vars":[{"title":"C0 Shield Comfort","role":"On-field Hydro DPS","weapons":["Tome of the Eternal Flow","Sacrificial Jade","Prototype Amber"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Keep usual HP, Hydro and CRIT stats; ER must still cover Burst rotations.","teams":"A reliable shield such as Zhongli or Citlali plus two reaction types when feasible.","when":"Use when enemy attacks would regularly interrupt the Charged Attack beam.","cond":"At C1, interruption resistance makes shielding less necessary.","notes":"Furina double Hydro can still outperform a third reaction stack at C0.","pre":false},{"title":"Lunar-Charged Driver","role":"On-field Hydro DPS","weapons":["Tome of the Eternal Flow","Sacrificial Jade","Prototype Amber"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Maintain HP, CRIT and sufficient ER; do not convert Neuvillette into an EM reaction trigger.","teams":"Columbina and Ineffa enable Lunar-Charged; add Kazuha or a compatible support.","when":"Use to combine his sustained Hydro beams with strong off-field Lunar-Charged damage.","cond":"Requires the relevant Lunar-Charged teammates.","notes":"Electro and Hydro reaction damage from teammates is separate from his Charged Attack scaling.","pre":false},{"title":"Hyperbloom Hydro Driver","role":"On-field Hydro DPS","weapons":["Tome of the Eternal Flow","Prototype Amber","Sacrificial Jade"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Keep normal HP and CRIT stats; stack EM on Raiden or Kuki, not on Neuvillette.","teams":"Dendro applicator plus full EM Electro trigger; shield is helpful at C0.","when":"Use when you want consistent Hyperbloom damage alongside his personal Hydro beams.","cond":"Electro trigger needs Level 90 and substantial EM.","notes":"Neuvillette supplies Hydro for Bloom; the Electro character owns Hyperbloom damage.","pre":false},{"title":"F2P Prototype Amber","role":"On-field Hydro DPS","weapons":["Prototype Amber","Ash-Graven Drinking Horn"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Use HP sands, Hydro or HP goblet, and CRIT circlet. ER may be lower with Prototype Amber.","teams":"Any off-field reaction enablers; prioritize shield for C0 comfort.","when":"Choose this for accessible HP scaling, Burst refund and team healing without premium weapons.","cond":"Ash-Graven is best when Energy needs are already low.","notes":"Prototype Amber supports Furina teams with extra party healing.","pre":false}],"mats":["Varunada Lazurite Sliver","Varunada Lazurite Fragment","Varunada Lazurite Chunk","Varunada Lazurite Gemstone","Fontemer Unihorn","Teachings of Equity","Guide to Equity","Philosophies of Equity","Transoceanic Pearl","Transoceanic Chunk","Xenochromatic Crystal","Lumitoile","Everamber","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 10"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6 - 8"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8 - 9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Judgment Day","members":["Neuvillette","Furina","Kaedehara Kazuha","Xilonen"]},{"name":"Moonlight Verdict","members":["Neuvillette","Columbina","Ineffa","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Frozen in Court","members":["Neuvillette","Furina","Escoffier","Citlali"]},{"name":"Bloom and Order","members":["Neuvillette","Nahida","Raiden Shogun","Zhongli"]}]}}],"title":"Neuvillette","el":"Hydro"}